{"seq":2,"slug":"water-activity-ph-hurdle","title":"水分活度与栅栏技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-safety-microbiology/control/water-activity-ph-hurdle","wordCount":2015,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"水分活度与栅栏技术\">水分活度与栅栏技术</h1><p>一根能在常温货架上放半年都不坏的意式萨拉米香肠，既没有冷藏也没有罐头杀菌，凭什么安全？答案是它同时翻过了好几道&quot;矮墙&quot;：盐降低了水分活度、发酵产酸压低了 pH、亚硝酸盐抑制了肉毒梭菌、干燥进一步脱水——没有任何单一手段能杀死所有微生物，但多道屏障叠加起来，就让任何微生物都无路可走。这就是栅栏技术（hurdle technology）的精髓。本篇深入水分活度这一最强大的内在因素，再把它和其他屏障组合成现代食品保藏的工程学。温度作为一道独立的栅栏在<a href=\"temperature-coldchain\">温度控制与冷链</a>中专讲，本篇聚焦水分与化学屏障的协同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>水分活度（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）衡量食品中&quot;可被微生物利用的自由水&quot;的比例，定义为食品上方平衡水蒸气压与纯水蒸气压之比，范围 0 到 1。它不同于含水量——盐和糖能&quot;束缚&quot;水分子，让食品即便含水不少，可用水却很少。栅栏技术则由德国学者 Leistner 提出，核心思想是：把多个本身不足以单独保藏的&quot;亚致死&quot;屏障（栅栏）智能组合，使微生物耗尽自身的内稳态储备而无法存活，从而在温和加工下实现安全与品质的兼顾。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[单一屏障常不够] --&gt; B[栅栏技术: 组合屏障]&#10;    B --&gt; C[水分活度 aw 降低]&#10;    B --&gt; D[pH 降低/酸化]&#10;    B --&gt; E[防腐剂]&#10;    B --&gt; F[温度]&#10;    B --&gt; G[气调包装]&#10;    C --&gt; H[微生物内稳态被耗竭]&#10;    D --&gt; H&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[安全 + 品质 + 经济]\">flowchart TD\n    A[单一屏障常不够] --&gt; B[栅栏技术: 组合屏障]\n    B --&gt; C[水分活度 aw 降低]\n    B --&gt; D[pH 降低/酸化]\n    B --&gt; E[防腐剂]\n    B --&gt; F[温度]\n    B --&gt; G[气调包装]\n    C --&gt; H[微生物内稳态被耗竭]\n    D --&gt; H\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[安全 + 品质 + 经济]</pre><p>水分活度的威力在于它为不同微生物画出了清晰的生存红线。下表给出关键阈值，这是配方设计的基础参照——其微生物学机理见<a href=\"../microbiology/growth-factors\">微生物生长与影响因素</a>，本篇关注如何用它做保藏。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 阈值</th>\n<th>被抑制的微生物</th>\n<th>典型食品</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;0.95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.95</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>多数革兰阴性菌、肉毒梭菌（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.94</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;0.94</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.94</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>加工肉、奶酪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.91</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;0.91</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.91</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>多数腐败细菌</td>\n<td>干腌肉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.86</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;0.86</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.86</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>金黄色葡萄球菌（产毒下限）</td>\n<td>浓缩果汁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.70</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;0.70</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.70</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>多数耐渗酵母</td>\n<td>果酱、蜂蜜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;0.60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.60</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>所有微生物</td>\n<td>饼干、奶粉、坚果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"水分活度-束缚水的科学\">水分活度：束缚水的科学</h2><p>理解水分活度，关键是区分&quot;含水量&quot;和&quot;可用水&quot;。一块咸肉和一块鲜肉可能含水量接近，但咸肉里大量水分子被钠离子的水合层束缚住，无法供微生物进行代谢和繁殖，于是它的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 远低于鲜肉。降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 有三条途径：物理去水（干燥、浓缩）、添加溶质（加盐、加糖，靠渗透压束缚水），以及冷冻（结冰把自由水变成固态，这也是冷冻保藏的部分机理，见<a href=\"temperature-coldchain\">温度控制与冷链</a>）。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与含水量的关系由&quot;水分吸附等温线&quot;（moisture sorption isotherm）描述——同一 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在不同食品中对应的含水量不同，这条曲线是干制食品配方和包装设计的核心工具。它还解释了一个常见失效：低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的干制品若包装不密封、存放在高湿环境，会吸潮使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 回升，原本的保藏屏障随之崩溃——这正是<a href=\"../microbiology/growth-factors\">微生物生长与影响因素</a>中相对湿度与水分活度耦合的实际后果。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w=0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> 是一条公认的绝对安全线：低于它，包括最耐旱的霉菌在内的所有微生物都无法生长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ph-与酸化保藏\">pH 与酸化保藏</h2><p>pH 是与水分活度并列的另一道强力栅栏。降低 pH（酸化）通过破坏微生物的胞内 pH 稳态来抑制生长，最关键的分界线仍是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>pH</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>4.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pH}=4.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pH</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.6</span></span></span></span></span>——低于此值，致死性最强的肉毒梭菌无法繁殖产毒，食品因此被法规归为&quot;酸性食品&quot;，可用温和的巴氏杀菌而非高压灭菌处理。这是泡菜、酸黄瓜、酸奶等发酵食品安全的根基。</p>\n<p>酸化有两条路径：发酵（fermentation，利用乳酸菌等有益微生物把糖转化为乳酸，天然降 pH，同时赋予风味，如酸菜、萨拉米、酸奶）和直接酸化（添加食用酸如醋酸、柠檬酸，如腌渍蔬菜）。发酵本质上是一种&quot;以菌制菌&quot;的生物栅栏——有益菌通过产酸、竞争营养和产生细菌素，主动压制致病菌和腐败菌。乳酸菌主导的发酵环境对沙门氏菌、李斯特菌等的抑制作用，把第一章的菌种生态知识转化成了主动的保藏武器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"栅栏技术-1-1-2-的保藏哲学\">栅栏技术：1+1&gt;2 的保藏哲学</h2><p>Leistner 提出栅栏技术的洞察是：单一屏障要达到保藏效果往往需推到极端（极咸、极酸、高温久煮），严重损害口感和营养；而把多道温和屏障组合起来，可在每道都&quot;留有余地&quot;的前提下实现同等甚至更好的安全性。其机理是协同的——微生物为对抗每一道亚致死压力（如轻度低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、轻度低 pH、少量防腐剂）都要消耗能量维持内稳态，多道压力叠加使其能量储备耗竭、修复机制崩溃，最终无法存活。这就是为什么组合屏障的效果大于各屏障单独效果之和。</p>\n<p>中式酱卤肉、火腿、腊肠都是栅栏技术的经典实践：盐降 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、亚硝酸盐抑肉毒梭菌、烟熏/卤煮的热处理、干燥脱水、有时加上发酵产酸，多道屏障共同造就了常温稳定又风味浓郁的产品。现代食品工业更把栅栏技术系统化，通过精确测量和配方优化设计&quot;最小加工&quot;（minimal processing）食品——既要安全货架期，又要尽量保留新鲜口感和营养。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>产品</th>\n<th>主要栅栏组合</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>萨拉米香肠</td>\n<td>低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + 低 pH（发酵） + 亚硝酸盐 + 干燥</td>\n<td>常温稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>果酱</td>\n<td>极低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（高糖） + 低 pH + 热处理</td>\n<td>常温长期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气调包装鲜肉</td>\n<td>冷藏 + 高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + 低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 表面</td>\n<td>延长冷藏货架期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酸奶</td>\n<td>低 pH（发酵） + 冷藏</td>\n<td>冷藏保鲜</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"其他栅栏与气调包装\">其他栅栏与气调包装</h2><p>除水分活度、pH、温度外，栅栏技术还可调用一系列辅助屏障。化学防腐剂（如山梨酸盐抑霉菌、苯甲酸盐抑细菌、亚硝酸盐抑肉毒梭菌）是高效栅栏，但其使用受 ADI 和限量约束，过量本身构成化学性危害（见<a href=\"../hazards/chemical-hazards\">化学性危害</a>）——这体现了保藏与安全的张力。天然抑菌物（如乳酸链球菌素 nisin、植物精油）作为&quot;清洁标签&quot;替代品日益受重视。</p>\n<p>气体组成是现代包装的核心栅栏：气调包装（MAP）通过提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 比例抑制好氧腐败菌、降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>O</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{O}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 延缓氧化，显著延长冷藏货架期。但它必须与其他栅栏（尤其冷藏）配合，因为低氧环境可能纵容厌氧的肉毒梭菌——这正是栅栏技术&quot;必须组合、不可单恃一道&quot;原则的反面教材。所有这些栅栏的有效组合，最终要通过 HACCP 体系做工艺验证（validation），确认其确实能控制目标危害，见<a href=\"../systems/haccp\">HACCP 危害分析</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>水分活度衡量可被微生物利用的自由水，不同于含水量；盐糖能束缚水使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降低，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w=0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> 以下所有微生物无法生长。</li>\n<li>降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可靠干燥、加溶质或冷冻；干制品吸潮会使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 回升导致保藏失效，须靠密封包装维持。</li>\n<li>pH 是另一道强力栅栏，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>pH</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>4.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pH}&lt;4.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pH</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.6</span></span></span></span></span> 抑制肉毒梭菌；酸化分发酵（以菌制菌）和直接加酸两条路径。</li>\n<li>栅栏技术把多道温和屏障智能组合，靠耗竭微生物内稳态实现 1+1&gt;2 的保藏效果，兼顾安全、品质与营养。</li>\n<li>化学防腐剂、天然抑菌物、气调包装都是辅助栅栏，但防腐剂受限量约束、气调需配合冷藏，组合需经 HACCP 验证。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"水分活度与栅栏技术","id":"水分活度与栅栏技术"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"水分活度：束缚水的科学","id":"水分活度-束缚水的科学"},{"level":2,"text":"pH 与酸化保藏","id":"ph-与酸化保藏"},{"level":2,"text":"栅栏技术：1+1>2 的保藏哲学","id":"栅栏技术-1-1-2-的保藏哲学"},{"level":2,"text":"其他栅栏与气调包装","id":"其他栅栏与气调包装"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"温度控制与冷链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-safety-microbiology/control/temperature-coldchain"},"next":{"title":"清洁消毒与卫生","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-safety-microbiology/control/cleaning-sanitation"}}